.DS_Store
__pycache__/

# IPEDS Access databases are huge (~600MB each, ~11GB total) and easily
# re-downloadable from nces.ed.gov via code/extract_ipeds.py --download.
# The per-school CSVs they produce live under data/scraped/ and are
# committed.
data/downloads/IPEDS/

# raw_ipeds.csv is the consolidated all-institutions IPEDS extract
# (~112 MB, ~1M rows). It exceeds GitHub's 100 MB per-file cap and is
# reproducible by running `uv run code/extract_ipeds.py` once the .accdb
# files are present. The 66-school subset (clean_ipeds.csv) and the
# merged clean.csv ARE committed under data/processed/.
data/processed/raw_ipeds.csv

# Quarto render artifacts
paper/paper_files/
paper/paper.html
